#: src/index.ts
msgid "Table Formatter"
msgstr "表の整形 (Table Formatter)"

#: src/index.ts
msgid "Auto (2 for Japanese, Chinese and Korean UI languages, otherwise 1)"
msgstr "自動（Joplin の言語が日本語・中国語・韓国語なら 2、それ以外は 1）"

#: src/index.ts
msgid "Always 1 (narrow)"
msgstr "常に 1（半角幅）"

#: src/index.ts
msgid "Always 2 (wide)"
msgstr "常に 2（全角幅）"

#: src/index.ts
msgid "Width of East Asian Ambiguous characters"
msgstr "曖昧幅の文字（East Asian Ambiguous）の幅"

#: src/index.ts
msgid ""
"Characters such as ※ ○ × ① α are rendered narrow in Western fonts and wide "
"in most CJK fonts. Choose the width that matches your editor font."
msgstr ""
"※ ○ × ① α などの文字は、欧文フォントでは半角幅、多くの CJK フォントでは全角幅"
"で表示されます。エディタのフォントに合わせて幅を選んでください。"

#: src/index.ts
msgid "Format Table"
msgstr "表を整形"
